# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt

# RustRover / IntelliJ IDEA
.idea/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Nix
.result*
result*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# LemMinX binary cache
lemminx
*.jar

# Logs
*.log